message_text:
fix(pro): production-review remediations — 30-day blocker set (ADR-0031)

MEM-01 temporal memory (event_time + as_of filtering end to end);
INJ-01 untrusted-content sentinels + sanitizer + poisoned golden case;
QUANT-01 HistoricalCorpus for as-of backtest context (labelled when absent);
QUANT-02 timeframe-inferred risk with daily-horizon VaR scaling (BTC/H1
now completes); QUANT-03 intrabar exit parity in the paper service;
MODEL-01 ModelBundle routing (quick teams / deep judge+critic+reflection);
REL-01 startup rehydration + per-iteration reconciliation gate;
SEC-01 dashboard API-key auth + loopback bind; SEC-02 requirements.lock,
lock-based image build, pip-audit in CI; EVAL-01 golden-case eval harness
with structural CI gate and real-model entry point; exponential retry
backoff and bind-once structured runnables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
